@startuml
title MEGA BRAIN — Diagrama de Componentes (limites físicos e de rede)

package "Máquina do Usuário (Windows)" {
  [Hermes Agent] as Hermes
  [Obsidian + Dataview] as Obs
  [Agendador de Tarefas] as Sched
}

package "80_SYSTEM (código versionado)" {
  [Hooks PowerShell\npre_/post_task_hook] as Hooks
  [MCP Server\nPython :8770] as MCP
  [Watcher\nPython] as Watch
  [Reindex Hybrid\nPowerShell] as Reidx
  [Backup\nrobocopy] as Bkp
}

node "Rede Local / Containers (validação)" {
  [Redis\ncache TTL] as Redis
  [Prometheus] as Prom
  [Grafana] as Graf
}

database "Vault Obsidian\n(fonte de verdade)" as Vault

Hermes --> Hooks : dispara (params PT)
Hooks --> Vault : lê/escreve (daily, MOC)
Hooks --> Reidx : Invoke-LightReindexIfNeeded
Reidx --> Vault : gera INDEX_GERAL.md
Watch --> Vault : monitora (debounce 2s)
Bkp --> Vault : copia (full/incremental)
Sched --> Reidx : agenda (6h / semanal)
Sched --> Bkp : agenda (diário)
Sched --> Watch : agenda

MCP --> Vault : Repository/Gateway (leitura/escrita)
Hermes --> MCP : HTTP REST (opcional)
MCP --> Redis : cache de /search (M3)
MCP --> Prom : /metrics (M3)
Prom --> Graf : dashboards

Obs --> Vault : renderiza dashboard vivo
@enduml
